  "discordPostHtml": "<p>Finally got around to updating this lol</p><p>A collection of mods which adds/buffs/modifies the Derelict Drones found out in the wild of Starsector. These mods should be 100% compatible with all other mods excluding major overhauls that aren't normally compatible with any other mods.</p><pre><code>Changelog:\n1.2\nVanilla+ and New Drones+\nAll vanilla derelicts have a low tech paintjob if you have magiclib.\nNew Drones+ a couple more ships have paintjobs, and all wings will recolour if used on a low tech painted derelict ship\n\n1.1\nVanilla+\nMothership fleet spawns reduced in size and quantity. Mod folder cleaned up. New save required for mothership changes.\n\nNew Drones+\nAdded 3 paintjobs if you are using Magiclib. The Dreadnought, Spirant and Rampart have gained a lowtech paintjob. I was bored lol\n\n\n1.0 (for 0.98)\nNew Drones+\nVanilla+\nI only updated the version for Vanilla+ and New Drones+ and did some balance changes (also added tags to the fortress and starfortress, need to test that though lol). Dunno about submods, I haven't touched them since... I think 0.96? :person_shrugging: </code></pre><p>Mods available:<br>All the Domain Drones+ Vanilla<br>Recommended new save if not already existing. I cannot guarantee this mod will work on an existing save (Motherships won't make drone fleets on existing games).<br>This mod modifies Vanilla drones, increasing their stats. It also upgrades the Domain Faction and allows Motherships and Survey Ships to spawn Derelict fleets as if they were [REDACTED] Battlestations. (Does not enhance Rampart or Guardian anymore)</p><p>Download Link:  <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/lxqxz8w8j4zemrx/Domain%20Drones%2B%20Vanilla.rar?dl=1\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/lxqxz8w8j4zemrx/Domain%20Drones%2B%20Vanilla.rar?dl=1</a></p><p>All the Domain Drones+ New Drones<br>Should work on existing saves for newly generated Domain fleets/garrisons.<br>This mod adds new Domain Drones. Capital ships, Cruisers, Destroyers, fuel ships, cargo ships, frigates, wings, mining ships, carriers and a new buildable Derelict Station (with three Tiers) to colonies. Also adds proper survey ships and probes to those explorable (as a civilian ship that is bulky enough to be in battles if needed). Derelict stations can also appear as Pirate stations, these send Derelict raids (you can also buy ships from them, don't ask why (ensuring you have a longterm supply of them)).</p><p>Download Link: <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/xxdaflon17jhg2k/All%20the%20Domain%20Drones%2B%20New%20Drones.rar?dl=1\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/xxdaflon17jhg2k/All%20the%20Domain%20Drones%2B%20New%20Drones.rar?dl=1</a></p><p>I also recommend DEX (if you had to choose between this or DEX, I would go DEX lol. That is better balanced, but you can do both!)</p>",
